[04:23.52]straiten [ˈstreɪtn]vt. 限制(范围、资金、数量等)；使窘 迫，使拮据
[04:28.56]glibly [ˈɡlɪbli]ad. 能说会道地；流利地，善辩地；肤浅 地 例 Most of them are citizens of European countries and speak their mother tongue glibly.
[04:41.52]compartmentalise [ˌkɒmpɑːtˈmentəlaɪz]vt. 分割；划分；区分 例 Business schools, who currently dominate entrepreneurship teaching and research, compartmentalise knowledge into functional boxes. 搭 compartmentalise sth. into sth. 把…分成…
[05:05.40]generate [ˈdʒenəreɪt]vt. 引起，导致；生殖，生育；产 生，发生 例 We need to establish relationships of mutual understanding and cooperation so as to generate empathy. 搭 generate electricity 发电
[05:23.40]gummed [ɡʌmd]a. 涂胶的 例 He used gummed reinforcements to hold the page in his holder.
