[05:40.08]overdraft [ˈəʊvədrɑːft]n. 透支；透支额
[05:43.68]manning [ˈmænɪŋ]n. 人员配备
[05:46.20]attributable [əˈtrɪbjətəbl]a. 可归于…的 例 We believe that the current decline in exports was mainly attributable to a drop in demand. 搭 attributable to 由于；可归因于
[06:02.04]mitigate [ˈmɪtɪɡeɪt]vt. 使缓和；减轻 例 The new staff mitigated the burden of the team leader.
[06:10.92]glassware [ˈɡlɑːsweə(r)]n.[总称]玻璃器皿；玻璃制品 例 One of our business sectors is importing chinaware, glassware and kitchenware products from China. 搭 glassware instrument 玻璃仪器
[06:28.68]synthesis [ˈsɪnθəsɪs]n. 综合，合成；综合体
[06:32.40]behaviour [bɪˈheɪvjə(r)]n. 举止；行为；表现；(待人的)态度 例 This is the sort of behaviour that encourages public distrust of the government. 搭 on one's best behaviour 行为检点 / social behaviour 社会行为
